WEBVTT

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:35.970
Then if the ball goes into
the goal area, you win.

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:38.390
And that's how <i>gitcho </i>works?

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:41.850
Apparently, the Nara monks
have been amusing themselves

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:45.900
by calling the ball Kiyomori's
head and smacking it around.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.610
That is horrible!

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:49.490
Would you like to hit it, too?

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:51.490
Hit Kiyomori's head?!

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:53.410
No, no! The ball.

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:55.910
Yes!

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:09.260
Biwa, what are you...

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:11.340
Stare.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.350
Come.

00:01:18.220 --> 00:01:21.810
Good kitty. You're clever.

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:24.600
Ah, the cat you took in in Fukuhara.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:29.190
They say cats attach to homes more than
people, so maybe it misses Fukuhara.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:35.530
I have to say, I'm surprised the capital
was moved back in just six months.

00:01:35.530 --> 00:01:36.870
Yes,

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:38.950
but it just feels right here.

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:59.180
THE HEIKE STORY

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:18.340
Episode 7

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:20.430
Emperor, are you cold?

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:22.810
Less than in Fukuhara.

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:29.770
When faced with Mt. Hiei's petition,
even Father had no choice but capitulate.

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:34.820
After all, no one wanted
to move in the first place.

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:37.400
And my father...

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:41.280
I paid him a visit recently. He is well.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:49.250
And I have heard of an uprising
among the monks of Kofukuji.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:52.380
They suspect the Heike
has returned to attack them.

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:54.500
Or so I am told.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.050
You heard about that...

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:04.890
Yoritomo has raised an army. It is no time
to be fighting with a temple in Nara!

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:11.770
Kaneyasu, head to Kofukuji and tell them
we have no intention of striking them.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.110
Yes, my lord.

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:17.070
You and your men are to wear no
armor and carry no bow or arrows.

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:22.780
Even if there is violence from their
side, you are not to use any force.

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:27.580
W-Wait! Please!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.620
Avenge Onjoji Temple!

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:43.850
They displayed their heads
at Sarusawa Pond?!

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:46.310
Those damned monks!

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:49.810
Fine, then!

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:52.810
Father, please, calm your rage.

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:54.110
Don't be ridiculous!

00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:59.150
They seized 60 unarmed men
and cut off their heads!

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:03.490
Shigehira, you will be
the commander. Go to Nara.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:04.530
Is that clear?

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:07.700
Yes, Father.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:11.250
Lord Shigehira.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:13.420
Dawn has broken. Lead the war cry.

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:18.510
The monks of Kofukuji
are armed only with swords.

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:22.340
If we attack with bows and arrows,
we should rout them easily!

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.570
The battle will drag on through nightfall.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:47.490
What is Shigehira doing?

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:51.000
The monks' resistance
was fiercer than anticipated.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:55.540
But, they seem to have broken through the
fortifications at Narasaka and Hannyaji.

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:00.050
Lord Shigehira, it has grown dark,

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:03.630
and there is no telling
where the monks are hiding.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:07.220
Should we not light a fire?

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.260
But that is how Onjoji...

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:14.310
The monks' fervor affected morale.

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:17.690
If attacked in the dark,
the soldiers will stand no chance.

00:06:22.780 --> 00:06:25.530
Set fire to a house to obtain light.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.030
But use great caution.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:44.720
What is it?

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.470
What an odd wind.

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:21.000
The flames burned down not
just Kofukuji, but also Todaiji!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.960
To think he'd set Nara ablaze entirely.

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:28.010
I only hope no divine wrath visits us.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:37.310
Hey, there.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:39.480
Hey, now!

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.270
This cat is just like you.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:42.440
I swear.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:48.360
The Heike made many
enemies for itself again.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:52.830
But wasn't it the wind's fault the fire
spread? We couldn't have done anything.

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:56.910
And the monks were
the source of all this trouble.

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.000
I am not so certain.

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:05.460
Brother, we are here today to visit
Mother. Try not to look so gloomy.

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:11.220
And nothing we say here will
put Nara back the way it was.

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:15.970
Sukemori and his lady friend
are back on good terms again,

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.930
so that's all he cares about.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:18.940
What?

00:08:23.610 --> 00:08:26.780
This was a lonesome New Year's.

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:32.490
Yeah. Possibly because the Nara temples
burned, there were no events held at all.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:37.250
I went to ask Lord Shigehira
to at least play the flute with me...

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.580
...but I didn't even get to see him.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:45.800
I suppose he must not be in the
mood to play the flute right now.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.300
Catch it.

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.600
Oh, my! I am ever so sorry!

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:57.810
What's wrong?

00:08:58.730 --> 00:08:59.890
The retired emperor is...

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.900
Mother, Father, what could
be so important?

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:12.280
His Majesty is in very serious condition.

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:16.700
It is precisely because of his
condition that we need to see you.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.540
Then please speak quickly.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:29.130
This concerns you and your position
after His Majesty's demise.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:33.090
What do you think of entering
Emperor Go-Shirakawa's palace?

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:36.600
Emperor Antoku is still young.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:41.390
It would be reassuring to have strong
support behind his court, right?

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:48.360
I trust I can pursue this matter?

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:51.610
No.

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:58.120
You still wish to make me
a tool for Father's ambitions?

00:09:58.120 --> 00:09:59.790
Tokuko.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:05.960
And to think you would bring
this up while His Majesty yet lives.

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:10.880
I have served Emperor Takakura
from the bottom of my heart.

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:13.470
No matter what may happen,

00:10:13.470 --> 00:10:16.600
I have no desire to serve
any other than His Majesty.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:24.270
Should you wish to force the matter...

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:31.860
...I will become a nun.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:34.490
Okay, okay. Put the blade away!

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:42.870
And then the idea was dropped.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.960
You're so valiant, Tokuko.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.880
It was the first time I opposed Father.

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:50.090
Biwa?

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:51.500
Biwa.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:52.800
Biwa?

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:54.130
Biwa.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.130
Biwa!

00:10:58.220 --> 00:10:59.390
Biwa!

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:00.470
That's right.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:08.400
I'll be all right.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:11.690
I'll live my life protecting this child.

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:19.620
I'm sure His Majesty is watching over us.

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:20.780
He has to be.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:26.870
It was just once,
but he spoke kind words to me.

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:30.540
I am thankful for you.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:35.920
At the time, I was disappointed
because he didn't express love.

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:41.350
But, my time at His Majesty's
side wasn't pointless, was it.

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:06.540
If only Tokuko could see this too.

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:12.380
Kiso no Yoshinaka?

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:15.550
Yes. Technically he is
a cousin of Yoritomo's.

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.170
Then he's Genji.

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:20.800
But it appears the situation
in the family is complicated.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.760
After Yoritomo's older brother
killed his father,

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:26.470
he fled to Kiso and grew up there.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:29.940
And <i>he </i>raised an army in Shinano?

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:33.900
Opportunist. He just went
along with Yoritomo.

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:40.490
Everyone is defying me lately.

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:43.200
Even my own daughter.

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:46.540
To think that after building up
the clan's glory,

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:49.500
I would be disliked and despised by all.

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:54.750
Father, the time for such lamenting
is after you strike down the Genji!

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.470
Quite right!

00:12:58.470 --> 00:13:01.010
Those outside our clan are not people!

00:13:02.640 --> 00:13:04.970
It is just as you two say.

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:09.020
Anyway...

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:13.270
...it sure is hot today.

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.400
Hot? But it is winter.

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:24.120
Word is people siding with the Genji have
cropped up in Kawachi, Kyushu, and Kumano.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:30.330
Uncle Munemori has declared that he will
become a commander and defeat them.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:34.250
Lord Shigehira appears to have
little appetite for battle

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.130
since the fire in Nara.

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:39.670
Is Lord Munemori truly up to this task?

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.470
What? Father is unwell?

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:45.350
Hot. So hot.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.510
Hot.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:47.970
Mother--

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:52.690
What on earth is going on?
His fever won't go down at all.

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:13.540
"Un"

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:23.590
Who are you?

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:27.350
We have come by the order of King Enma.

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:28.470
King Enma?!

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:32.480
We have come for Kiyomori.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:36.310
He burned temples and
burned the Great Buddha,

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:39.690
and for that he is now
being roasted in flames.

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:44.360
He shall sink to the bottom of the
Avici hell of uninterrupted suffering.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.910
How dreadful!

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:06.590
Hot...

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:12.020
So hot...

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:17.520
Lord Kiyomori, if you have
any final wishes...

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:24.240
Spread my ashes...
at the beach at Fukuhara...

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:26.150
I will.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:30.280
I have achieved all
my desires in this life.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:38.580
I regret... only... the fact that
I never saw Yoritomo's head.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:43.170
I need no halls or pagodas
erected after I die.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:45.130
Hold no service either.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:52.010
Just send people after Yoritomo...
cut off his head...

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:55.430
...and hang it before my grave.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:01.270
I wonder if...

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.400
...Tokuko is still upset with me.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:24.300
It's... on fire.

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:30.140
Emergency!

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:32.470
Lord Kiyomori's estate!

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:33.850
What happened?

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.280
Shigemori.

00:16:49.990 --> 00:16:53.240
Kiyomori is... Your Pa is...

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:59.160
What should I do?

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:05.130
Those I know and those
I don't--everyone just dies.

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:06.880
And it won't stop here.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:13.600
Is there... anything I can do?

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:22.350
Koremori?

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:25.070
Tell me.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:28.990
Father died, and now Grandfather has, too!

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:31.490
What is going to happen to the Heike?

00:17:31.490 --> 00:17:33.490
What happens to us?

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:34.660
Say it!

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:36.450
Hold nothing back!

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:37.490
Brother!

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:40.870
Go back inside and rest.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.080
I want to know!

00:17:43.080 --> 00:17:46.380
The north, the east, the west--

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:49.050
they've all sided with the Genji.

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:52.930
Father is gone. Grandfather is gone.

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:55.010
What do we do now?

00:17:57.140 --> 00:18:00.680
This is why you flee at
the sound of waterfowl.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:05.190
Even if you knew, what could <i>you </i>do?

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:06.650
Nothing.

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:10.440
Brother is... just tired!

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:15.820
From the journey... to Fukuhara and
back... for Grandfather's funeral.

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.960
Biwa, I apologize.

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:32.260
Biwa.

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:34.130
Leave.

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:38.760
I've always found the color
of your eye creepy.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:41.390
And I hated the sound of your biwa.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:43.350
Brother, how can you--

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:47.560
We should have thrown
you out after Father passed.

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:51.820
You don't belong here,
and you haven't for some time!

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:52.820
Behave.

00:18:54.650 --> 00:18:56.360
You hear me?

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:58.620
Leave before spring comes.

00:18:58.620 --> 00:18:59.740
Brother!

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:04.370
Biwa...

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:06.670
I know.

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:09.880
I know Sukemori well.

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:34.820
At last, my confinement is lifted
and I have returned.

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:38.200
I am sorry for the inconveniences
you experienced.

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:44.410
I would have liked to make
Kiyomori bow his head like that.

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:50.250
But, even if he fell to the Avici hell,
I bet he's clawing his way up.

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:56.260
Mikonohimegimi entered my palace.

00:19:56.260 --> 00:19:59.890
Her mother is different,
but she is your little sister.

00:19:59.890 --> 00:20:02.760
I heard she was an Itsukushima priestess.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:07.310
She's a beautiful girl,
but she is always so quiet.

00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:11.520
You would have made a
good conversation partner.

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:14.440
I will continue to visit you when I can.

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:18.280
If you will permit it, I would
visit Mikonohimegimi too.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:19.910
Oh, you will?

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:26.160
She did end up in an unwanted marriage
to an old man like me in your place.

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:30.210
An unwanted fate is not
necessarily a misfortune.

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:37.010
I have seen many who met with
misfortune by wanting too much.

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:42.220
They were slaves to their desires, never
realizing what they lost in exchange.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:47.680
I wish to be the flower
that blooms even in mud.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:54.730
♪ Women have five obstructions. ♪

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:59.450
♪ Though they are far from
reaching the pure land, ♪

00:20:59.450 --> 00:21:04.740
♪ like the lotus flower blooming in mud, ♪

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:11.000
♪ even the dragon girl
achieved enlightenment. ♪

00:21:20.630 --> 00:21:22.220
You may not see it,

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:27.390
but you have already been dragged down
into an uninterrupted quagmire.
